":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3489510,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>SHINOBI: Art of Vengeance Digital Deluxe Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361770/extras/92ef986bd58a52d03de14003b2329566.avif?t=1772105366\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase the SHINOBI: Art of Vengeance Digital Deluxe Edition and receive the Starter Pack, Digital Art Book &amp; Soundtrack, and SEGA Villains Stage, featuring Dr. Eggman and two additional bosses based on iconic SEGA villains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Base Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Digital Deluxe Season Pass:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >o Starter Pack: the Ghost Outfit, the Medic Lite Amulet, and 2000 Gold</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >o SEGA Villains Stage (Coming Early 2026)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >o Digital Art Book + Soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Gold is collected during gameplay and cannot be purchased separately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361770/extras/750c708089757fa30f5d688feb01c57e.avif?t=1772105366\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361770/extras_big/750c708089757fa30f5d688feb01c57e.webp?t=1772105366 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The iconic SHINOBI returns in an all-new 2D action platformer with a unique hand-drawn look created by the team behind the hit brawler Streets of Rage 4.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the legendary Shinobi Joe Musashi, master of the ninja arts. After finding your village burned to the ground and your clan turned into stone, you must set off on a quest for vengeance, ready to face an unparalleled evil and avenge your clan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361770/extras/0119a83049a0447226c0a1e9097ef69f.poster.avif?t=1772105366\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361770/extras/0119a83049a0447226c0a1e9097ef69f.webm?t=1772105366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361770/extras/0119a83049a0447226c0a1e9097ef69f.mp4?t=1772105366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>EXECUTE THE NINJA ARTS WITH PRECISION</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield your vast ninja arsenal including the great Katana Oborozuki, Kunai, Ninjutsu arts, and Ninpo to vanquish your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361770/extras/6020ba08ab5850baaea14202ade211fb.poster.avif?t=1772105366\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361770/extras/6020ba08ab5850baaea14202ade211fb.webm?t=1772105366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361770/extras/6020ba08ab5850baaea14202ade211fb.mp4?t=1772105366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>MASTER THE WAY OF THE SHINOBI</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash limitless combos with unique combat moves, acquire Amulets for enhanced abilities, and discover Ningi tools to overcome obstacles and uncover new paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361770/extras/cb54dfaf308e0d711d6dc03763123850.poster.avif?t=1772105366\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361770/extras/cb54dfaf308e0d711d6dc03763123850.webm?t=1772105366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361770/extras/cb54dfaf308e0d711d6dc03763123850.mp4?t=1772105366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>JOURNEY THROUGH A STYLISTIC NEW WORLD</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through more than a dozen unique and visually striking stages, from military bases to a scorching desert, challenging platforming puzzles, and hidden secrets. </p>","developers":["SEGA","Lizardcube"],"dlc":[3381260,3381210],"drm_notice":"Denuvo Anti-tamper","genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361770/e9ea86d314aee27fd903e95c626598c09244d468/header.jpg?t=1772105366","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u24b8SEGA. All rights reserved. SEGA is registered in the U.S. Patent and Trademark Office. SEGA, the SEGA logo and SHINOBI ART OF VENGEANCE are registered trademarks or trademarks of SEGA CORPORATION. All other trademarks, logos and copyrights are pr